# File Structure

Keep artifacts in the declared tree. Do not dump creatives into repo root.

| Dir | Role |
|-----|------|
| CONTEXT/ | Brand, product, voice, forbidden |
| RESEARCH/ | Sourced notes |
| TASKS/ | Work queue |
| ORG/ | Creative org chart |
| EXPERTS/ | Seed experts + sources |
| SCENARIOS/{urun}/{n}/ | Parallel agent isolation |
| MATRIX/ | Spec + checklist |
| BRIEFS/ | Production briefs |
| CANVA_OPS/ | Queue, registry, validation |
| QA/ | QA reports |
| ARCHIVE/{YYYY-MM}/ | Snapshots |

Update root `STATE.md` after each phase command.
